    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gorgeous in Galtymore!\n\n16 Galtymore Park is a beautiful three bedroom, mid-terraced home with generous south facing garden and a fantastic sunroom extension. Superbly located in a quiet residential crescent in Drimnagh, yet close to shops, schools and public transport, this lovely home is well maintained throughout. \n\nLocated just a short stroll from the Red Line LUAS, this fine property enjoys close proximity to a host of local amenities including LUAS, parks, shops and schools. This home further benefits from a large and sunny south facing garden. \n\nThe spacious and well-laid-out accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, a bright and generously proportioned living room, an open plan kitchen with dining area and a fantastic sunroom overlooking the magnificent rear garden. Upstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms and a family bathroom. Galtymore Park is perfectly tucked away just off Galtymore Road, providing a most private and a peaceful setting. The driveway to front is cobble-locked, providing excellent off-street parking. \n\nThe location is second to none in this highly sought-after area with LUAS, numerous bus routes and the M50 all within easy reach, offering excellent connectivity throughout Dublin and beyond, including a direct route to Dublin Airport. The best of schools, shops, and local amenities are all close at hand. \n\nContact Michael in Young`s Estate Agents to arrange your viewing.\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
