        "Content": "<ul><li> Three bedroom home </li><li> Well maintained throughout </li><li> South facing garden </li><li> Superb residential location </li><li> Close to LUAS </li><li> Driveway parking </li><li> Gas fired central heating </li><li> 89 sq.m / 958 sq.ft approx.</li></ul>"
      },
